Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?Patch=200190:=20the=20Spanish=20of=20the=20card?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20list,=20medal=20and=20chart=20rows=20and=20of=20the=20name?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20keyboard;=20the=20keyboard=20types=20=C3=B1=20=C3=91=20and?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20the=20accented=20vowels=20in=20both=20languages;=20DG.SCN=20?=
